        "acid",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>Bun the Black spits a ball of caustic mucus up to a range of 50 feet that explodes in a 10ft Type:burst. Creatures within the burst take 4d8 Acid Damage damage (Basic DC 21 Reflex Saving Throw save). Those that fail this save also take 1d6 Persistent,acid Damage damage and take a –5-foot status penalty to their Speed. This Speed reduction ends with the persistent acid damage. Bun the Black can't use Caustic Mucus again for 1d6 rounds.</p>\n<p>Effect: Caustic Mucus</p>",
